---
/**
 * PopAd.astro — the ProfitON popunder tag.
 *
 * Deliberately NOT in BaseLayout. Two reasons:
 *
 * 1. AdSense. The site runs AdSense on every page, and AdSense policy
 *    disallows placing its ads on pages carrying pop-ups or popunders that
 *    interfere with navigation. Loading this everywhere would put the whole
 *    AdSense account at risk, which is worth far more than the pop revenue.
 *    Keeping it off the pages a policy reviewer looks at first — legal, about,
 *    contact, editorial — limits the exposure.
 *
 * 2. Revenue per impression is not flat. A popunder pays on the click that
 *    opens it, so it earns on pages where visitors already click a lot: the
 *    player, a title page where they are choosing where to watch, the APK
 *    download page. On a privacy policy it earns nothing and costs goodwill.
 *
 * Include it per page, never globally. See PLACEMENT below for the current set.
 */
---

{/* ProfitON popunder. data-cfasync="false" keeps Cloudflare Rocket Loader from
    deferring it, which the vendor requires for the tag to fire on first click. */}
<script
  data-cfasync="false"
  async
  type="text/javascript"
  src="//wk.sortallav.com/rRTB1HjUh1Q/149339"
  is:inline
></script>
